 #2c3e50;\">{{ $('Create Shopify Product').item.json.id }}</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color: #27ae60; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0;\">✓ Your book has been successfully added to our catalog!</p>\n    <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ecf0f1; margin: 30px 0;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 5px;\">With warm regards,</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #2c3e50; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;\">Team Yellow Feather</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
